Praised Hanuman swells and whisks tail --- Greets elders and claims matchless leaping --- Boasts circling Meru and flooding worlds --- Vows outstripping Garuda and reaching sun --- Promises Sita sight and Lanka lifting --- Jambavan entrusts mission with blessings --- Monkeys stake lives and await on one foot --- Hanuman chooses Mahendra peak for takeoff --- Climbs Mahendra and shakes mountain with beasts fleeing --- Composes mind and sets forth for Lanka